## Chi tiết theo từng mảng

### 1. Core Features — 90% ✅

**Đã có đầy đủ:**
- 30+ screens: auth flow, diary flow, AI flow, stats flow, profile flow
- Food search, custom dish, meal diary, water tracking
- Stats/biểu đồ (day/week/month), achievements, notifications
- Voice input, AI scan, recipe suggestions, nutrition insights
- Barcode scanner (mới ship), weekly review

**Thiếu (P1-P2):**
- [ ] Favorites / recent foods / "same as yesterday" (manual logging speed)
- [ ] Meal planner, grocery list
- [ ] Intermittent fasting, wearable sync
- [ ] Premium tiering

---

### 2. Auth & Security — 80% ✅

**Hoạt động tốt:**
- ✅ Email/password login + registration + email verification
- ✅ Google Sign-In (verified trên device thật 2026-04-15)
- ✅ Forgot/reset password qua Brevo (verified trên Gmail thật)
- ✅ JWT + refresh token (30 ngày) + expo-secure-store
- ✅ Rate limiting: Auth 10/min, AI 20/min, General 100/min

**Chưa ổn:**
- ⚠️ Password reset codes lưu `IMemoryCache` — mất khi Render restart/scale
- ⚠️ Google env vars chưa update trên Render production
- ⚠️ `GenerateJwtToken()` copy-paste ở 2 controller (rủi ro inconsistency)

