### 4. Backend API — 88% ✅

**Kiến trúc vững:**
- 25 controllers covering: auth, food, diary, AI, voice, water, nutrition, summary, telemetry, health, admin
- Clean Architecture: Controllers → Services → Repositories → EF Core
- Health checks: `/health/live`, `/health/ready` (DB query thật)
- `EnableRetryOnFailure()`, security headers middleware, connection pool detection

**Build status:**
- ✅ `dotnet build` pass
- ✅ Focused `dotnet test` pass (auth, analytics, food, barcode, weekly-review)

---

### 5. Mobile App Quality — 78% ✅

**Tốt:**
- ✅ TypeScript typecheck pass
- ✅ Jest unit tests pass (telemetry, AI client retry, AI service, water, summary, food, logger)
- ✅ 50+ chỗ `useMemo/useCallback` đúng cách
- ✅ Android preview APK build pass + install emulator pass
